Section: 1 INTRODUCTION
Text: In addition to the mutual coverage, a bag representa- tion in word level is issued to help discover the main points of a bag. The bag representation then provides new matching evidence to the query-bag matching model. We conduct experiments on the AliMe and Quora dataset for the query-bag matching based information-seeking conversation. Compared with baselines, we verify the effectiveness of our model.

